    "text": "12 minutes ago Check NWS updates here\nEffective: 2026-06-10 23:25:00 CDT Expires: 2026-06-10 23:34:00 CDT Urgency: Immediate Severity: Severe Certainty: Observed Target Area: McLean, IL; Tazewell, IL The storms which prompted the warning have weakened below severe limits, and no longer pose an immediate threat to life or property. Therefore, the warning will be allowed to expire. However, gusty winds and heavy rain are still possible with these thunderstorms.\nA Severe Thunderstorm Watch remains in effect until 100 AM CDT for central Illinois.",
